    "rich_text_g7bqKf": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_Xe4b3w": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h2>The Origin of I AM MIAMI</h2>\n<p>The idea for <strong>I AM MIAMI</strong> was born from years of weekly commutes between Miami and New York. At NYC airports, the iconic <strong>I <span class=\"heart\">❤</span> NY</strong> logo was impossible to miss — a bold symbol of city pride. The question naturally followed: <em>Why doesn't Miami have an icon like that?</em>\n</p><p>\nThat question sparked the creation of <strong>I AM MIAMI</strong> — a brand designed to capture the spirit of the Magic City.\n</p><p>\nA simple but powerful discovery changed everything: the word <em>MIAMI</em> holds <em>I AM</em> at its center. It was bold, personal, and unforgettable. We knew we had found something special.\n</p><p>\nFrom there, the vision came to life — experimenting with fonts, colors, shapes, and styles until the perfect expression of the brand emerged. The result: a symbol that speaks to the energy, diversity, and pride of Miami.\n</p><p>\n<strong>I AM MIAMI</strong> is a celebration of the city’s vibrant culture, food, nightlife, art, business, and unstoppable spirit. It represents everyone who finds a part of themselves in this city.\nA brand. A mindset. A badge of Miami pride.\n</p>",
            "text_size": 16,
            "text_line_height": 1,
            "margin_top_text": 20,
            "text_color": "#3d4243",
            "text_width": "650px"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "text_Xe4b3w"
      ],
      "disabled": true,
      "custom_css": [
