    "rich_text_iG7dEV": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_XkTAGt": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>I AM MIAMI</strong> was born flying back and forth between NYC and the Magic City — seeing <em>I <span class=\"heart\">❤</span> NY</em> everywhere and wondering, where’s our symbol?</p>\n\n<p>Then we saw it: <strong>MIAMI has “I AM” in it.</strong> <br>Bold. Loud. Local.</p>\n\n<p>This isn’t a brand for tourists.<br>\nIt’s for the ones who say oye and bro in the same breath.\nWho salsa in sneakers. Who know the shortcuts, the smells after the rain, and the silent codes of the 305 and 786.\n</p>\n\n<p>We don’t do souvenirs. We wear the city. We’re not the view — we’re the vibe.</p>\n \n<p>And because we care about keeping Miami real — not just repping it — <strong>I AM MIAMI supports and sponsors efforts that protect what makes this place magic</strong></p>\n\n<p><strong>I AM MIAMI. For locals only.</strong></p>",
            "text_size": 16,
            "text_line_height": 1,
            "margin_top_text": 20,
            "text_color": "#3d4243",
            "text_width": "650px"
          }
        }
      },
